window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-047-aed3fa0ba0fe6c3b.json"]={sha256:"aed3fa0ba0fe6c3b784ec347289a203d82f13a11d85b1470f3e5dbc93d3e2dad",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-03197d83dc430913","url":"https://www.quera.com/neutral-atom-platform","title":"Building Quantum Computers with Neutral Atoms","titleEn":"Building Quantum Computers with Neutral Atoms","publisher":"QuEra","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-047","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-047","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-048","referenceUrls":["https://atom-computing.com/quantum-computing-technology/"],"title":"Atom Computing 核自旋控制：相位噪聲對比","titleEn":"Atom Computing nuclear-spin control: phase-noise contrast","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付熱速度、無量綱相位展寬及Doppler／雷射噪聲診斷矩陣。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver thermal velocity, dimensionless phase spread and Doppler/laser-noise discrimination. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『Atom Computing 核自旋控制：相位噪聲對比』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付相位分布、兩正交分量與小噪聲近似誤差表。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Atom Computing nuclear-spin control: phase-noise contrast', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver phase distributions, coherence quadratures and small-noise approximation errors.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：一維熱速度σv=sqrt(kBT/m)，高斯Doppler對比C=exp[−(keffσvt)²/2]；keff為兩光子有效波向量，非任一單束波數。 使用教學m=1.443×10⁻²⁵ kg、T=10 μK、keff=10⁶ m⁻¹、t=10 μs。 以手算或試算表計算名義式exp(-((1e6*sqrt(1.380649e-23*10e-6/1.443e-25)*10e-6)**2)/2)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：確認keffσvt無量綱；比較−lnC正比T，並將keff=0列作忽略其他噪聲時的理想極限。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：若相位誤差零均值Gaussian、RMS為σφ，平均相干對比C=exp(−σφ²/2)；固定相位偏差需另外校正。 使用教學σφ=0.2 rad；相位是弧度，不能直接代入角度值。 以手算或試算表計算名義式exp(-0.2**2/2)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以小σ近似1−σ²/2交叉檢查，列出精確與近似殘差，不將近似外推σ=3。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: One-dimensional σv=sqrt(kBT/m) gives Gaussian Doppler contrast C=exp[−(keffσvt)²/2]; keff is the effective two-photon wavevector. Use Teaching m=1.443×10⁻²⁵ kg, T=10 μK, keff=10⁶ m⁻¹ and t=10 μs. Evaluate nominal expression exp(-((1e6*sqrt(1.380649e-23*10e-6/1.443e-25)*10e-6)**2)/2) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check dimensionless keffσvt; verify−lnC scales with T and use keff=0 as an ideal limit excluding other noise.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For zero-mean Gaussian phase error with RMS σφ, averaged coherence contrast C=exp(−σφ²/2); fixed phase bias needs separate correction. Use Teaching σφ=0.2 rad; phase is in radians, not numerical degrees. Evaluate nominal expression exp(-0.2**2/2) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Cross-check with1−σ²/2 for small σ, record residuals and do not extrapolate to σ=3.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-057","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-08820-7"],"title":"矽光子干涉網路：相位漂移與控制餘裕","titleEn":"Silicon-photonic networks: phase drift and control margin","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付熱速度、無量綱相位展寬及Doppler／雷射噪聲診斷矩陣。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver thermal velocity, dimensionless phase spread and Doppler/laser-noise discrimination. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"由微小光程變化預測干涉相位，而非只監看總光功率。","differenceEn":"Predict interference phase from optical-path changes instead of monitoring total optical power alone.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：一維熱速度σv=sqrt(kBT/m)，高斯Doppler對比C=exp[−(keffσvt)²/2]；keff為兩光子有效波向量，非任一單束波數。 使用教學m=1.443×10⁻²⁵ kg、T=10 μK、keff=10⁶ m⁻¹、t=10 μs。 以手算或試算表計算名義式exp(-((1e6*sqrt(1.380649e-23*10e-6/1.443e-25)*10e-6)**2)/2)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：確認keffσvt無量綱；比較−lnC正比T，並將keff=0列作忽略其他噪聲時的理想極限。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。波長1550nm，光程漂移10nm；本題已將折射率變化併入光程。 Δφ=2π×10/1550。 代入 2*pi*10/1550，得到 0.0405367 rad。相位φ=2πOPL/λ；局部線性且波長固定，溫度與應力可同時改變光程。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: One-dimensional σv=sqrt(kBT/m) gives Gaussian Doppler contrast C=exp[−(keffσvt)²/2]; keff is the effective two-photon wavevector. Use Teaching m=1.443×10⁻²⁵ kg, T=10 μK, keff=10⁶ m⁻¹ and t=10 μs. Evaluate nominal expression exp(-((1e6*sqrt(1.380649e-23*10e-6/1.443e-25)*10e-6)**2)/2) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check dimensionless keffσvt; verify−lnC scales with T and use keff=0 as an ideal limit excluding other noise.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Wavelength1550nm, optical-path drift10nm; index changes are already included in optical path. Δφ=2π×10/1550. Substituting 2*pi*10/1550 gives 0.0405367 rad. Phaseφ=2πOPL/λ; locally linear at fixed wavelength, with thermal and stress contributions to optical path. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-9e8cba3a789ff3a4","url":"https://atom-computing.com/quantum-computing-technology/","title":"Quantum Computing Technology","titleEn":"Quantum Computing Technology","publisher":"Atom Computing","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-ff15b0b67f0cb15d","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-08820-7","title":"A manufacturable platform for photonic quantum computing","titleEn":"A manufacturable platform for photonic quantum computing","publisher":"PsiQuantum team / Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
